WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.080
How can you know there are 8 without counting?

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.770
Use a ten frame.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.530
Two rows of five.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:11.020
A full row is 5, + 3 more is 8.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:14.016
Your eyes see it instantly.
